{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delta Directive</strong> is a fast-paced online PvP arena game where precision, strategy, and quick reflexes decide the victor. Step into a world of futuristic combat, where elite operatives battle across dynamic maps in intense, skill-based showdowns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive PvP Action</strong> \u2013 Challenge players worldwide in thrilling online matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Classes</strong> \u2013 Choose from diverse classes, each with specialized weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill over Pay-to-Win</strong> \u2013 Victory comes from mastery, timing, and strategy\u2014not wallet size.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you thrive on fast duels or coordinated team battles, <i>Delta Directive</i> delivers high-stakes, adrenaline-fueled competition. Adapt, outplay, and dominate\u2014because in this directive, only the sharpest survive.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3095180?t=1761442042","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095180/85cdc1d187331d9b94e899b484ce41dcb50f764d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761442042","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095180/22e566c90f9a711da20617f07aafccd7fd9cc3e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761442042","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095180/22e566c90f9a711da20617f07aafccd7fd9cc3e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761442042","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delta Directive</strong> is a f